index 4e7e124748e97814e1d9df5a925f546430a9a32e..ac6e940c13aa292bc5b41b1807a3444b2033f826 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -5,6 +5,13 @@ a title, a priority and a few tags, tick them off when they are done, and look a
 urgent first. This package holds the list itself, in TypeScript; the app's screens use its public API
 from `src/index.ts`.
 
+## Task timestamps
+
+Every task exposes `createdAt` and `updatedAt` as ISO-8601 date-time strings. They are equal when a
+task is added. Successful changes to its title, status or tags update `updatedAt`; rejected operations
+and operations that leave the task unchanged do not. `createTodoList` accepts an optional timestamp
+provider for deterministic use; by default it uses the current time.
+
 Each task has a stable `id` unique within its list. Use `get(id)` to retrieve a task, and pass its id
 to `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove`. Renaming a task does not change
 its id.
